yunmai-noble-simulator
======================

The virtual scale runs as a separate service on loopback:

  systemctl status yunmai-noble-simulator
  journalctl -u yunmai-noble-simulator -f

Open the simulator web app at http://127.0.0.1:3100/simulator/ to power
the scale, pick a weight, and step on and off. Measurements are stored
in /var/lib/yunmai-noble-simulator/historian.sqlite.

The "Yunmai Noble Simulator" desktop entry opens the same client against
port 3100 and starts this service on demand.

Configuration: /etc/yunmai-noble/simulator.toml
Environment:   /etc/yunmai-noble/simulator.env

The real Bluetooth service keeps running on port 3000 and its own
database; the two services do not share state.
